# N4 (LMX_semantics.ru.md #exits: an exit that ends the activation publishes the changed own working fields first;
# #exceptions: a zero divisor is the implicit interpreter throw): S makes x dirty (42) and then divides by zero.
# The throw leaves S, which first publishes x into the place of its data: D\x is 42 in the handler of run. Entry 7.
int: zero 0
int: seen 0
S:
    int: x
    x: x + 1
    node\seen: x / node\zero
end: S
D:
    int: x 41
end: D
fn: run () int
    int: r 82
    call: S D
    catch: interpreter ()
        r: 83
        if: D\x = 42
            r: 7
    ---
return: r
int: got run()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: got; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
